<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;"># 应该显示：arn:aws:sts::PRODUCTION_ACCOUNT_ID:assumed-role/CrossAccountECRReadRole/EC2PullSession</span></span>
